    "detailed_description": "<h1>Community</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1716760/extras/39ba7de79b605ffba3e4b2510086ca1d.avif?t=1752516807\" /></div></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1716760/extras/6879e66f62fa7ddc34e0d2c48458213f.poster.avif?t=1752516807\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1716760/extras/6879e66f62fa7ddc34e0d2c48458213f.webm?t=1752516807\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1716760/extras/6879e66f62fa7ddc34e0d2c48458213f.mp4?t=1752516807\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Trinity Archetype</strong> is a roguelite, turn-based RPG where you fight deadly enemies trying to take over your broken world.<br><br>Customize and create unique party builds, analyze upcoming actions to plan your own, and use the unique Skill Boost and Party Inspire mechanics to get the upper hand in battle. Every run is different!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1716760/extras/8a99bd8c64e653502fb9c24cd1f1c991.avif?t=1752516807\" /></div><br>Once per turn, a party member can inspire their allies in order to activate new interesting effects. Inspiring at the right moment can turn the battle around in your favor!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1716760/extras/82ca2030ed64b3939daaefaabb8b9b45.poster.avif?t=1752516807\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1716760/extras/82ca2030ed64b3939daaefaabb8b9b45.webm?t=1752516807\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1716760/extras/82ca2030ed64b3939daaefaabb8b9b45.mp4?t=1752516807\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1716760/extras/53a201517dfcf02cb21953d1b4a7c8bd.avif?t=1752516807\" /></div><br>Power-up your skills during battle by spending Boost Points! Each skill has extra effects depending on your boost level.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1716760/extras/d1223680ae29e92ede8f9fa7dbd1c826.poster.avif?t=1752516807\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1716760/extras/d1223680ae29e92ede8f9fa7dbd1c826.webm?t=1752516807\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1716760/extras/d1223680ae29e92ede8f9fa7dbd1c826.mp4?t=1752516807\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1716760/extras/b622689fec40ea692f419595587bdce9.avif?t=1752516807\" /></div><br>Level up your characters and unlock new skills after each battle then further enhance them by equipping Runes and unleash their full potential! There are millions of possibilities to try!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1716760/extras/9144d9187573686462da650511a4aafa.poster.avif?t=1752516807\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1716760/extras/9144d9187573686462da650511a4aafa.webm?t=1752516807\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1716760/extras/9144d9187573686462da650511a4aafa.mp4?t=1752516807\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1716760/extras/f53e2fd4c54b7d0a53fc5d2e942a1bbb.avif?t=1752516807\" /></div><br>Find your way through the corruption left by Chaos and its minions, while trying to save the world from the brink of destruction.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1716760/extras/1e5270edc3ad20aa4c98d4ae5f9625ee.avif?t=1752516807\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1716760/extras/018b320f9f2e8805a3655639e5452f7b.avif?t=1752516807\" /></div>",
